        },
        {
          "text": "Ubu ni bgo buryo umwami Salomo yashizeh’ abanyabikebere bo kwubaka ingoro y’Uhoraho n’ingoro yiwe ubgiwe n’i Milo n’uruzitiro rw’amabuye rw’i Yerusalemu, n’i Hasori n’i Megido n’i Gezeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
