              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abuzukuruza babo bari barasigaye mu gihugu, abo Abisirayeli batāshoboye guherengeteza rwose, abo ni bo Salomo yatojemw’ abo gushinga ibikebere, abahindura abaja na bugingo n’ubu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.21",
