            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo ni bo bakoresha bakuru bāgaba ibikorwa vya Salomo; bose na bose bār’ amajana atanu na mirongwitanu, bārāba abantu mu bikorwa.",
          "type": "text",
