        {
          "text": "Kandi Salomo yahora atanga ibimazi vyo kwoswa n’ivy’ ishimwe gatatu‐gatatu mu mwaka, abitangira ku gicaniro yubakiye Uhoraho, akosereza n’imibavu imbere y’Uhoraho.",
